(5491438, 791827, 106576, '<td valign="top">What I like about this photo is that "Mini Me" looks like she is more than willing to do anything you ask her too!..:)<br/>More seriously I really like your creativity, just the fact that you have a different color blouse/top (we men don''t know about these names!:) )is an important thing to me in the believability if that''s a word, of the photo. POV, DOF good. You might want to watch your horizon line. I know because it almost always get me and others have helped me with it.</td>', 'What I like about this photo is that "Mini Me" looks like she is more than willing to do anything you ask her too!..:)More seriously I really like your creativity, just the fact that you have a different color blouse/top (we men don''t know about these names!:) )is an important thing to me in the believability if that''s a word, of the photo. POV, DOF good. You might want to watch your horizon line. I know because it almost always get me and others have helped me with it.', '2009-05-18 16:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5491460, 791820, 106576, '<td valign="top">I like this! I may be dense but I don''t follow what the patern in behind it, is it an old sewing machine? Anyway cool perspective!</td>', 'I like this! I may be dense but I don''t follow what the patern in behind it, is it an old sewing machine? Anyway cool perspective!', '2009-05-18 16:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5491466, 791829, 106576, '<td valign="top">I think everyone is going to love this, I do!<br/>The texture of each persons''s skin add to it. Alsojust the personal aspect as people relate to maybe a father or grandfather and baby! Nice work1</td>', 'I think everyone is going to love this, I do!The texture of each persons''s skin add to it. Alsojust the personal aspect as people relate to maybe a father or grandfather and baby! Nice work1', '2009-05-18 16:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5491473, 791609, 98647, '<td valign="top">The left side is a bit distracting to me. I would have cropped it off. Nice image otherwise.</td>', 'The left side is a bit distracting to me. I would have cropped it off. Nice image otherwise.', '2009-05-18 16:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5491479, 791833, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting abstract. It looks to me like a lot of Native Americans (Indians) on horses galloping towards me. The white parts on top are their feathered headdresses. It''s got a lot of motion to it. But I don''t get a "miniature city" from it nor do I see how it meets the challenge.</td>', 'This is an interesting abstract. It looks to me like a lot of Native Americans (Indians) on horses galloping towards me. The white parts on top are their feathered headdresses. It''s got a lot of motion to it. But I don''t get a "miniature city" from it nor do I see how it meets the challenge.', '2009-05-18 16:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5491482, 791408, 43774, '<td valign="top">A cute setup, good lighting. I like the stars in the background too.</td>', 'A cute setup, good lighting. I like the stars in the background too.', '2009-05-18 16:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5491483, 791708, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice looking tree, cute setup with the glass ball. The lighting looks too harsh and the photo seems too contrasty.</td>', 'Nice looking tree, cute setup with the glass ball. The lighting looks too harsh and the photo seems too contrasty.', '2009-05-18 16:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
