(5491841, 791842, 43774, '<td valign="top">This almost looks like  a miniature set up but I don''t think anyone would go through that much trouble. Good job.</td>', 'This almost looks like  a miniature set up but I don''t think anyone would go through that much trouble. Good job.', '2009-05-18 22:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5491842, 791694, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice bright colours, I like it!</td>', 'Nice bright colours, I like it!', '2009-05-18 22:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5491843, 790600, 43774, '<td valign="top">Not something you see every day, wow!</td>', 'Not something you see every day, wow!', '2009-05-18 22:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5491844, 791634, 43774, '<td valign="top">They certainly look miniature, good processing.</td>', 'They certainly look miniature, good processing.', '2009-05-18 22:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5491908, 791748, 81362, '<td valign="top">Flower looks normal size, so miniature depends only on title. Background might be more effective if all greeen grass and none of the pavers.</td>', 'Flower looks normal size, so miniature depends only on title. Background might be more effective if all greeen grass and none of the pavers.', '2009-05-18 23:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5491911, 791819, 81362, '<td valign="top">Pinwheel looks normal size, so challenge fit hinges just on the title. Even so, the blades might do better moved into a more even patch of light to bring out the colors better and diminish the irregular and distracting shadows.</td>', 'Pinwheel looks normal size, so challenge fit hinges just on the title. Even so, the blades might do better moved into a more even patch of light to bring out the colors better and diminish the irregular and distracting shadows.', '2009-05-18 23:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5491912, 791833, 81362, '<td valign="top">As an abstract suggestive of a large group African dance, it could work pretty well, but the image doesn''t convey "miniature" very clearly.</td>', 'As an abstract suggestive of a large group African dance, it could work pretty well, but the image doesn''t convey "miniature" very clearly.', '2009-05-18 23:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5491918, 791249, 81362, '<td valign="top">Distance makes normal things look small, but culture trains our eyes to see them as normal size. If I take in the title, "Little" league compared to "major" league makes a fit. But sports magazines have my eyes expecting sharp background as well as subjects.</td>', 'Distance makes normal things look small, but culture trains our eyes to see them as normal size. If I take in the title, "Little" league compared to "major" league makes a fit. But sports magazines have my eyes expecting sharp background as well as subjects.', '2009-05-18 23:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5491919, 791495, 81362, '<td valign="top">Model might appear more miniature if something large could be included in the image for scale. Blur effect clearly deliberate but not so clearly enhancing the image to my eyes (recognizing that a lensbaby effect interests many others).</td>', 'Model might appear more miniature if something large could be included in the image for scale. Blur effect clearly deliberate but not so clearly enhancing the image to my eyes (recognizing that a lensbaby effect interests many others).', '2009-05-18 23:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5491924, 790198, 81362, '<td valign="top">Some of the little toy pictures aren''t as good as this one, which comes across with a sense of humor, like a cartoon. Omitting the monitor and lighter (?desktop) background would have enhanced this a lot for me. Unhappy having to give a vote for the whole thing, would rather vote 6 on the bottom two thirds and 2 or 3 for the top third.</td>', 'Some of the little toy pictures aren''t as good as this one, which comes across with a sense of humor, like a cartoon. Omitting the monitor and lighter (?desktop) background would have enhanced this a lot for me. Unhappy having to give a vote for the whole thing, would rather vote 6 on the bottom two thirds and 2 or 3 for the top third.', '2009-05-18 23:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5491927, 791806, 81362, '<td valign="top">Sky is dramatic if somewhat large. Tower gives no hint of being miniature.</td>', 'Sky is dramatic if somewhat large. Tower gives no hint of being miniature.', '2009-05-18 23:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5491931, 791841, 81362, '<td valign="top">Perspective translates the people as being normal size rather than miniature. Nice tree shadows and good graphic trash container. The blue sky/background comes off as artificial with this treatment. Consider trying a version with more of the blue cropped away and maybe a bit of the right side for balance.</td>', 'Perspective translates the people as being normal size rather than miniature. Nice tree shadows and good graphic trash container. The blue sky/background comes off as artificial with this treatment. Consider trying a version with more of the blue cropped away and maybe a bit of the right side for balance.', '2009-05-18 23:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5491932, 791714, 81362, '<td valign="top">Contrast between toy tourists in front and real tourists in back rather subtle. Intersting location.</td>', 'Contrast between toy tourists in front and real tourists in back rather subtle. Intersting location.', '2009-05-18 23:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5491935, 790978, 81362, '<td valign="top">These objects seem normal size instead of miniature. Will be interesting to read your photographer notes when this is done.</td>', 'These objects seem normal size instead of miniature. Will be interesting to read your photographer notes when this is done.', '2009-05-18 23:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5491947, 791829, 81362, '<td valign="top">Contrast between tiny and large, horizontal and upright, darker and lighter, young and old all do well with the simplification of black and white, and the composition makes one of the top images of this challenge.</td>', 'Contrast between tiny and large, horizontal and upright, darker and lighter, young and old all do well with the simplification of black and white, and the composition makes one of the top images of this challenge.', '2009-05-18 23:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
