(5497226, 790961, 86447, '<td valign="top">Adorable flowers.  I fear that the scale isn''t clear with nothing to compare it to, so folks can''t figure out if this is ''miniature''.  Well lit.</td>', 'Adorable flowers.  I fear that the scale isn''t clear with nothing to compare it to, so folks can''t figure out if this is ''miniature''.  Well lit.', '2009-05-23 11:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497228, 791760, 86447, '<td valign="top">I think folks will have trouble viewing this as ''miniature'' instead of full-sized from far away.    I like the BW and the boat trail with the curve of the land.</td>', 'I think folks will have trouble viewing this as ''miniature'' instead of full-sized from far away.    I like the BW and the boat trail with the curve of the land.', '2009-05-23 11:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497232, 790493, 86447, '<td valign="top">Adorable!  ANd I like how you gave it all scale by including the other objects.  Just the thimble itself would not have been enough.<br/> <br/>The shadowa are distracting a bit, I think the lighting could have been improved.</td>', 'Adorable!  ANd I like how you gave it all scale by including the other objects.  Just the thimble itself would not have been enough. The shadowa are distracting a bit, I think the lighting could have been improved.', '2009-05-23 11:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497235, 791640, 86447, '<td valign="top">Including the child is brilliant!   I like the slight motion blur to him, too.</td>', 'Including the child is brilliant!   I like the slight motion blur to him, too.', '2009-05-23 11:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497236, 791767, 86447, '<td valign="top">I need something to give this a sense of scale in my mind, I think.  Nicely captured ripples.</td>', 'I need something to give this a sense of scale in my mind, I think.  Nicely captured ripples.', '2009-05-23 11:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497238, 791495, 86447, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t appear miniature to me... I wish there were something to show that it''s a model... somthing to give it scale.  Not voting yet.</td>', 'This doesn''t appear miniature to me... I wish there were something to show that it''s a model... somthing to give it scale.  Not voting yet.', '2009-05-23 11:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
