(5497240, 791714, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is wonderfully done.  The scene, and then real folks to give the scale.   Composition is perfect.  I''m not totally sold on the processing, but that''s just my opinion.   Not voting yet.</td>', 'This is wonderfully done.  The scene, and then real folks to give the scale.   Composition is perfect.  I''m not totally sold on the processing, but that''s just my opinion.   Not voting yet.', '2009-05-23 11:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497241, 791816, 86447, '<td valign="top">LOL @ your title.   Too cute. <br/> <br/>I like how you gave us a real dog so we get the sense of scale.  Perhaps if it were a bit shsrper (more DOF?) then this would score more highly.  Still, I like it.   Not voting.</td>', 'LOL @ your title.   Too cute.  I like how you gave us a real dog so we get the sense of scale.  Perhaps if it were a bit shsrper (more DOF?) then this would score more highly.  Still, I like it.   Not voting.', '2009-05-23 11:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497244, 790360, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea... but it seems a bit busy.  Perhaps if you''d taken the shot with the tanks and men on a ''hill'' and the background would be less obtrusive?   Not voting.</td>', 'This is a good idea... but it seems a bit busy.  Perhaps if you''d taken the shot with the tanks and men on a ''hill'' and the background would be less obtrusive?   Not voting.', '2009-05-23 11:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
