(5497246, 791805, 86447, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve divided the image with the lines of the real auto.   Well done.  The red reflecting in the logo is terrific!  Not voting.</td>', 'I like how you''ve divided the image with the lines of the real auto.   Well done.  The red reflecting in the logo is terrific!  Not voting.', '2009-05-23 11:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497247, 791421, 86447, '<td valign="top">LOL!   Good stuff!  Not voting.</td>', 'LOL!   Good stuff!  Not voting.', '2009-05-23 11:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497248, 791811, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful image.   I fear that the voters will not think of the full-sized baby as a miniature, though... *sigh*   Not voting.</td>', 'This is a wonderful image.   I fear that the voters will not think of the full-sized baby as a miniature, though... *sigh*   Not voting.', '2009-05-23 11:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497249, 791371, 86447, '<td valign="top">What a great idea!   I''m not sure how voters will consider this miniature, since the butterfly is a full-sized butterfly, at least... perhaps larger, huh?    Not voting.</td>', 'What a great idea!   I''m not sure how voters will consider this miniature, since the butterfly is a full-sized butterfly, at least... perhaps larger, huh?    Not voting.', '2009-05-23 11:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497251, 791762, 86447, '<td valign="top">LOL!   Such a fun image!   Good job.  The scale is perfectly shown with the other items in the scene and the water is fabulous!  Not voting.</td>', 'LOL!   Such a fun image!   Good job.  The scale is perfectly shown with the other items in the scene and the water is fabulous!  Not voting.', '2009-05-23 11:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497252, 791642, 86447, '<td valign="top">The whites being blown here are most likely giving this a lower score than it could have earned since it''s an adorable scene, well composed.  It also seems to tilt to the right a bit (see building edge - should be totally horizontal, yes?).   Not voting.</td>', 'The whites being blown here are most likely giving this a lower score than it could have earned since it''s an adorable scene, well composed.  It also seems to tilt to the right a bit (see building edge - should be totally horizontal, yes?).   Not voting.', '2009-05-23 11:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497254, 791697, 86447, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is lacking in an otherwise adorable scene, I fear.  I want to see into the truck and the truck''s shadow is hiding whatever the Legoman is working on.   Not voting.</td>', 'The lighting here is lacking in an otherwise adorable scene, I fear.  I want to see into the truck and the truck''s shadow is hiding whatever the Legoman is working on.   Not voting.', '2009-05-23 11:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
