(5497256, 791822, 86447, '<td valign="top">Voters here at DPC will ding you, I fear, for the gravel (?) in upper left.  Perhaps a different background altogether would give you a higher score for this.  It, especially with the grass, seems a bit busy and competes with the subjects.   Not voting.</td>', 'Voters here at DPC will ding you, I fear, for the gravel (?) in upper left.  Perhaps a different background altogether would give you a higher score for this.  It, especially with the grass, seems a bit busy and competes with the subjects.   Not voting.', '2009-05-23 11:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497257, 791408, 86447, '<td valign="top">Very well done.   One of my favorites of the challenge.  The stars and rocks are a perfect backdrops for this.   Not voting.</td>', 'Very well done.   One of my favorites of the challenge.  The stars and rocks are a perfect backdrops for this.   Not voting.', '2009-05-23 11:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497258, 791699, 86447, '<td valign="top">LOL @ your title!  I think this is more of a macro than a shot of a miniature something, though, since the ant is a full-sized ant.  But, that''s just one opinion.   Not voting.</td>', 'LOL @ your title!  I think this is more of a macro than a shot of a miniature something, though, since the ant is a full-sized ant.  But, that''s just one opinion.   Not voting.', '2009-05-23 11:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497260, 791536, 86447, '<td valign="top">Fabulous image!  I really like the setup and composition.   Some voters might argue that, even though it''s a miniature car, it''s more known for being a full-sized Monopoly playing piece.  Just a heads-up in case you''re not getting many comments as some have said they aren''t.  Not voting.</td>', 'Fabulous image!  I really like the setup and composition.   Some voters might argue that, even though it''s a miniature car, it''s more known for being a full-sized Monopoly playing piece.  Just a heads-up in case you''re not getting many comments as some have said they aren''t.  Not voting.', '2009-05-23 11:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497261, 791810, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is one of my top ten images in the challenge.   I like the man being almost the only thing in focus.   The composition is odd with him looking out of the photo, but it definitely works in this image.   Not voting.</td>', 'This is one of my top ten images in the challenge.   I like the man being almost the only thing in focus.   The composition is odd with him looking out of the photo, but it definitely works in this image.   Not voting.', '2009-05-23 11:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497262, 791748, 86447, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting here...   But, it seems that this is a full-sized flower in a full-sized watering can.  If I''m wrong, it''s because there''s nothing to give me a different sense of scale in the image.   It also might have been better if the flower were fresh and not wilted.  These are just my opinions, of course... but I like to hear everyone''s opinion on my images.   Not voting.</td>', 'I like the lighting here...   But, it seems that this is a full-sized flower in a full-sized watering can.  If I''m wrong, it''s because there''s nothing to give me a different sense of scale in the image.   It also might have been better if the flower were fresh and not wilted.  These are just my opinions, of course... but I like to hear everyone''s opinion on my images.   Not voting.', '2009-05-23 11:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497264, 791744, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is a fabulous image.  But, I fear it is a macro instead of ''miniature'' since the snails are full-sized snails, not replicas in smaller form.   Not voting.</td>', 'This is a fabulous image.  But, I fear it is a macro instead of ''miniature'' since the snails are full-sized snails, not replicas in smaller form.   Not voting.', '2009-05-23 11:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497265, 791664, 86447, '<td valign="top">What an adorable plane!  I like how you gave us the ruler for scale, but the image is too small to score well here, I fear.  Use the entire 720 pixels, if you can.  Voters will ding you for this every time.   Not voting.</td>', 'What an adorable plane!  I like how you gave us the ruler for scale, but the image is too small to score well here, I fear.  Use the entire 720 pixels, if you can.  Voters will ding you for this every time.   Not voting.', '2009-05-23 11:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497266, 791143, 86447, '<td valign="top">Since these are full-sized flowers, I fear the voters will ding you for it in this ''miniature'' challenge.   Perhaps if you had put in a larger flower with it for scale... Not voting.</td>', 'Since these are full-sized flowers, I fear the voters will ding you for it in this ''miniature'' challenge.   Perhaps if you had put in a larger flower with it for scale... Not voting.', '2009-05-23 11:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
