(5497270, 791841, 86447, '<td valign="top">These folks seem full-sized to me.  If I''m wrong it''s because there''s nothing to change my sense of the scale here for comparison.   Not voting.</td>', 'These folks seem full-sized to me.  If I''m wrong it''s because there''s nothing to change my sense of the scale here for comparison.   Not voting.', '2009-05-23 11:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497271, 790978, 86447, '<td valign="top">This seem full-sized with creative photography to me.  If I''m wrong it''s because there''s nothing to change my sense of the scale here for comparison.  It looks like a DNMC to me since I can''t see it''s miniature. Not voting.</td>', 'This seem full-sized with creative photography to me.  If I''m wrong it''s because there''s nothing to change my sense of the scale here for comparison.  It looks like a DNMC to me since I can''t see it''s miniature. Not voting.', '2009-05-23 11:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
