(5497279, 791542, 86447, '<td valign="top">Brilliant idea!  Well done!   The scale is given by the dandelion and it has a definite reason for being in the shot.  Black background is wonderful, too.    Not voting.</td>', 'Brilliant idea!  Well done!   The scale is given by the dandelion and it has a definite reason for being in the shot.  Black background is wonderful, too.    Not voting.', '2009-05-23 11:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497282, 791691, 86447, '<td valign="top">With the legs crossed and not being able to see the knees to know it, it seems like her feet are deformed, going out at the wrong angles.  I like the idea of the little shoe.  Good for you for hte clever idea.   Not voting.</td>', 'With the legs crossed and not being able to see the knees to know it, it seems like her feet are deformed, going out at the wrong angles.  I like the idea of the little shoe.  Good for you for hte clever idea.   Not voting.', '2009-05-23 11:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
