(5497289, 791823, 86447, '<td valign="top">LOL!   This is so adorable!   I like the angle you took it from... but the lighting is not as good as it could be.  The harsh shadows are distracting.  More light from the rear, perhaps?  And some into the interior of the car?<br/> <br/> I''m sure you had only a short amount of time to catch this, but I really need to see both eyes of the hamster.  *sigh*    Not voting.</td>', 'LOL!   This is so adorable!   I like the angle you took it from... but the lighting is not as good as it could be.  The harsh shadows are distracting.  More light from the rear, perhaps?  And some into the interior of the car?  I''m sure you had only a short amount of time to catch this, but I really need to see both eyes of the hamster.  *sigh*    Not voting.', '2009-05-23 11:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
