(5497788, 791806, 47906, '<td valign="top">I really like the processing that you have done in this shot, The detail in the brick of the lighthouse is really cool along with the detail in it makes it look very nice. <br/> <br/>The blue in the sky is really deep in tonality. It almost looks to blue. The burning of the clouds you did really sets a mood to the scene. You have a couple pieces of sensor dust in the lower right corner that you should have cloned out. However I really like the overall detail in throughout the clouds and sky.</td>', 'I really like the processing that you have done in this shot, The detail in the brick of the lighthouse is really cool along with the detail in it makes it look very nice.  The blue in the sky is really deep in tonality. It almost looks to blue. The burning of the clouds you did really sets a mood to the scene. You have a couple pieces of sensor dust in the lower right corner that you should have cloned out. However I really like the overall detail in throughout the clouds and sky.', '2009-05-23 22:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497926, 791714, 96901, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... this looks a bit grainy.  I like the concept though.</td>', 'Hmmm... this looks a bit grainy.  I like the concept though.', '2009-05-24 02:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
