(5498370, 791810, 1031, '<td valign="top">For this technique I''ve found that the compositions which work best have all the major elements either parallel or perpendicular to the sensor plane -- the effect depends on objects at the same distance exhibiting the same degree of blurriness. In this case, the row of planters being blurry on the right doesn''t look quite right to me. This looks like a good location -- I think a shot from here with people seated at the right-most table would work pretty well.</td>', 'For this technique I''ve found that the compositions which work best have all the major elements either parallel or perpendicular to the sensor plane -- the effect depends on objects at the same distance exhibiting the same degree of blurriness. In this case, the row of planters being blurry on the right doesn''t look quite right to me. This looks like a good location -- I think a shot from here with people seated at the right-most table would work pretty well.', '2009-05-24 17:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5498371, 791693, 1031, '<td valign="top">The teacher will have a problem reading your homework!</td>', 'The teacher will have a problem reading your homework!', '2009-05-24 17:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
