(5498612, 791609, 83313, '<td valign="top">One of the most original shots in this challenge that I have seen so far. The feel of it is great. I want to know haw you shot and post processed this.</td>', 'One of the most original shots in this challenge that I have seen so far. The feel of it is great. I want to know haw you shot and post processed this.', '2009-05-24 22:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5498613, 790360, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the shot seems a snap. Comes of as very busy and nothing really stands out from the grass. I suppose that''s really the point of camouflage, after all.</td>', 'I like the idea, but the shot seems a snap. Comes of as very busy and nothing really stands out from the grass. I suppose that''s really the point of camouflage, after all.', '2009-05-24 22:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5498614, 791659, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''ll be very curious to see how this fares in voting. I wonder if the razor thin DOF will be taken by most as a flaw or artistic intent. As for myself, I think it''s awesome work. A fave and a high vote for this one.</td>', 'I''ll be very curious to see how this fares in voting. I wonder if the razor thin DOF will be taken by most as a flaw or artistic intent. As for myself, I think it''s awesome work. A fave and a high vote for this one.', '2009-05-24 22:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
