(5498817, 791804, 83313, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your achievement, I think. I had actually suspected <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=53814" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">pointandshoot</a>''s entry was yours.</td>', 'Congrats on your achievement, I think. I had actually suspected  pointandshoot''s entry was yours.', '2009-05-25 02:05:43.000000', NULL, 0),
