(5498820, 791542, 100831, '<td valign="top">Very creative - excellently photographed.</td>', 'Very creative - excellently photographed.', '2009-05-25 02:09:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5498821, 791756, 77196, '<td valign="top">A bit obscure for the voters, I''m sure, but a nice image. Love the light trail &amp; glow. Might have been a bit more obvious if the Apple logo was right side up from the viewer''s perspective.</td>', 'A bit obscure for the voters, I''m sure, but a nice image. Love the light trail & glow. Might have been a bit more obvious if the Apple logo was right side up from the viewer''s perspective.', '2009-05-25 02:11:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5498822, 791421, 100831, '<td valign="top">Very lovely colors - all in all, very well thought out and taken. Congratulations!</td>', 'Very lovely colors - all in all, very well thought out and taken. Congratulations!', '2009-05-25 02:11:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5498823, 791603, 28742, '<td valign="top">Way to go, David! Congrats on top ten!</td>', 'Way to go, David! Congrats on top ten!', '2009-05-25 02:13:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5498824, 791493, 41337, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by GeneralE:</b></div><hr/><i> Apparently a lot of voters don''t include this type of shot in the category of "miniature" -- in this case, I''d suggest even more blurring towards the top and bottom regions to make the effect even more pronounced. Your composition and subjects are fine. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I looked up the word <i>literal</i> in the dictionary but all I found was a photo of the DPC voting mass. ''Nuff said.</td>', 'Originally posted by GeneralE: Apparently a lot of voters don''t include this type of shot in the category of "miniature" -- in this case, I''d suggest even more blurring towards the top and bottom regions to make the effect even more pronounced. Your composition and subjects are fine.   I looked up the word literal in the dictionary but all I found was a photo of the DPC voting mass. ''Nuff said.', '2009-05-25 02:15:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5498826, 791317, 77196, '<td valign="top">Must say I don''t "get" the voters. This is a very nice image. Two things I think hurt - the top of the basket being cropped off, and the dark part just inside the basket between the two peppers. The other factor, I think, was that there just wasn''t whatever it is that makes voters give out 6''s. Your voting graph has to be one of the most consensus ones I''ve ever seen - a ton of 5''s (more than 2x as much as any other vote) - just the few more 4 &amp; 3 (and the obligatory 2) kept this from being over 5. I''m surprised you didn''t get a "shallower depth of field" comment, but I like that you''ve kept the entire subject in focus.</td>', 'Must say I don''t "get" the voters. This is a very nice image. Two things I think hurt - the top of the basket being cropped off, and the dark part just inside the basket between the two peppers. The other factor, I think, was that there just wasn''t whatever it is that makes voters give out 6''s. Your voting graph has to be one of the most consensus ones I''ve ever seen - a ton of 5''s (more than 2x as much as any other vote) - just the few more 4 & 3 (and the obligatory 2) kept this from being over 5. I''m surprised you didn''t get a "shallower depth of field" comment, but I like that you''ve kept the entire subject in focus.', '2009-05-25 02:16:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5498829, 791750, 96530, '<td valign="top">Way to go Penny! Perfect shot for the challenge.</td>', 'Way to go Penny! Perfect shot for the challenge.', '2009-05-25 02:18:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5498830, 791344, 77196, '<td valign="top">And obviously played with. Someone spent lots of hours painting these. I was looking for HIT (my hobbit) for this challenge, but couldn''t find him... (they are, after all, known for being able to remain unseen when large folk are about).</td>', 'And obviously played with. Someone spent lots of hours painting these. I was looking for HIT (my hobbit) for this challenge, but couldn''t find him... (they are, after all, known for being able to remain unseen when large folk are about).', '2009-05-25 02:20:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5498831, 791609, 67145, '<td valign="top">congratulations alan on such an excellent photograph and the red ribbon .. what a brilliant find and how perfect for the challenge .. :)<br/></td>', 'congratulations alan on such an excellent photograph and the red ribbon .. what a brilliant find and how perfect for the challenge .. :)', '2009-05-25 02:22:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5498833, 791642, 77196, '<td valign="top">Try finding a horizontal line to make parallel with the top or bottom. It looks like you lined up the vertical edge of the building and the trees, but the shot still feels tilted. Also, it looks slightly OOF to me (but may just be my eyesight!). Great idea &amp; setup. I like the old-fashioned photographer in the scene. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Try finding a horizontal line to make parallel with the top or bottom. It looks like you lined up the vertical edge of the building and the trees, but the shot still feels tilted. Also, it looks slightly OOF to me (but may just be my eyesight!). Great idea & setup. I like the old-fashioned photographer in the scene.  ', '2009-05-25 02:23:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5498835, 791684, 67145, '<td valign="top">this made me smile its so cute and clever and i love your original take on the challenge .. would''v looked real good with a red ribbon underneath .. oh well .. we win some and we lose some .. but this is so not a 5.5 .. :)</td>', 'this made me smile its so cute and clever and i love your original take on the challenge .. would''v looked real good with a red ribbon underneath .. oh well .. we win some and we lose some .. but this is so not a 5.5 .. :)', '2009-05-25 02:24:26.000000', NULL, 0),
