(5499010, 791542, 25355, '<td valign="top">Quirky - who would employ a jack-hammerer to work on a dandelion puff ball? I like it.<br/>  I''ve been wanting to get such figures but the ones here that I can find are imported from Germany or somewhere, and are really expensive.</td>', 'Quirky - who would employ a jack-hammerer to work on a dandelion puff ball? I like it.  I''ve been wanting to get such figures but the ones here that I can find are imported from Germany or somewhere, and are really expensive.', '2009-05-25 06:26:30.000000', NULL, 0),
