(5499013, 791829, 67363, '<td valign="top">My PB! I am so excited to get so close to a ribbon too! I thought there would be heaps of baby toes, fingers etc. in this challenge. I was just lucky my 6 week old grandson,Cobey was visiting and my husband Graeme was home.<br/>       Thankyou for the wonderful comments and advise...I am grateful of anything!</td>', 'My PB! I am so excited to get so close to a ribbon too! I thought there would be heaps of baby toes, fingers etc. in this challenge. I was just lucky my 6 week old grandson,Cobey was visiting and my husband Graeme was home.       Thankyou for the wonderful comments and advise...I am grateful of anything!', '2009-05-25 06:38:18.000000', NULL, 0),
