(5499029, 791750, 6958, '<td valign="top">The best shot in the challenge. Chapeau!</td>', 'The best shot in the challenge. Chapeau!', '2009-05-25 07:38:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5499043, 791787, 3724, '<td valign="top">You are a good caretaker - wonderful presentation.</td>', 'You are a good caretaker - wonderful presentation.', '2009-05-25 08:23:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5499082, 791421, 42091, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> What is the figure driving the tractor? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Regarding who/what is driving the tractor - Lena is driving the tractor; Ole was sick and off work the day the picture was taken.<br/> <br/>Lena is a 3/16 inch section of a farmers'' (wooden) match.  For arms and hands, a hole was drilled in the wooden portion just under the match''s head to allow insertion of a very fine, covered copper wire. Hips are ''blu-tack'' (actually corn kernal color).<br/> <br/>The same material is peeking out from behind one tractor wheel; it was used to hold the tractor in place and maintain tension on the tow chains.</td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: What is the figure driving the tractor?   Regarding who/what is driving the tractor - Lena is driving the tractor; Ole was sick and off work the day the picture was taken. Lena is a 3/16 inch section of a farmers'' (wooden) match.  For arms and hands, a hole was drilled in the wooden portion just under the match''s head to allow insertion of a very fine, covered copper wire. Hips are ''blu-tack'' (actually corn kernal color). The same material is peeking out from behind one tractor wheel; it was used to hold the tractor in place and maintain tension on the tow chains.', '2009-05-25 09:02:20.000000', NULL, 0),
