(5499330, 791815, 62357, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>Well, you got me again!  Hopefully you are finding some of the comments I make useful?<br/> <br/>I was disappointed this did not do better and notice that you did not even get any comments, which is not too helpful.<br/> <br/>I liked the concept a lot, clearly it is a photo of some doll''s house furniture.  The composition works well, although possibly a lower angle would have been better.  I think the thing that hurt it the most as far as your score goes is the lack of focus.  The depth of field is so very shallow and the mini frying pan, which is the main subject, is not totally in focus.  This to my mind is what really hurt this one.<br/> <br/>If it''s any consolation to you, I did give it a 6 as I liked the subject.</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club Well, you got me again!  Hopefully you are finding some of the comments I make useful? I was disappointed this did not do better and notice that you did not even get any comments, which is not too helpful. I liked the concept a lot, clearly it is a photo of some doll''s house furniture.  The composition works well, although possibly a lower angle would have been better.  I think the thing that hurt it the most as far as your score goes is the lack of focus.  The depth of field is so very shallow and the mini frying pan, which is the main subject, is not totally in focus.  This to my mind is what really hurt this one. If it''s any consolation to you, I did give it a 6 as I liked the subject.', '2009-05-25 13:12:04.000000', NULL, 0),
