(5502649, 791804, 66384, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your ribbon. I really like this image. The blur and color blends are very pleasing to me. I like the grain too. And the subject is obviously very small and is sharp enough. So be proud of your ribbon. You earned it the hard way -- with a good image.</td>', 'Congratulations on your ribbon. I really like this image. The blur and color blends are very pleasing to me. I like the grain too. And the subject is obviously very small and is sharp enough. So be proud of your ribbon. You earned it the hard way -- with a good image.', '2009-05-27 17:23:16.000000', NULL, 0),
